  "solution": "Given expression: 6 × 7 ÷ 9 + 3 - 8\n\nAfter replacing the numbers and signs, we get:\n\n1. + and ÷, 7 and 8\n\n__**6 × 8**__ + __**9 ÷ 3**__ - 7\n\n= __**48 + 3**__ - 7\n\n= __**51 - 7 **__\n\n= 44\n\n2. + and -, 6 and 8\n\n8 × __**7 ÷ 9**__ - 3 + 6\n\n= __**8 **____**× 0.77**__ - 3 + 6\n\n= __**6.16**__ - 3 __**+ 6**__\n\n= __**12.16 - 3**__\n\n= 9.16 \n\n3. × and +, 8 and 6\n\n8 + __**7 ÷ 9**__ × 3 - 6\n\n= 8 + __**0.77 ×**____** 3**__ - 6\n\n= __**8 + 2.31**__ - 6\n\n= __**10.31 - 6**__\n\n= 4.31\n\n4. × and , 9 and 6\n\n__**9 ÷ 7**__ × 6 + 3 - 8\n\n= __**1.28 ×**____** 6**__ + 3 - 8\n\n= __**7.68 + 3**__ - 8\n\n= __**10.68 - 8**__\n\n= 2.68\n\nHence, '**+ and ÷, 7 and 8**' is the correct answer.",
